    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "&quot;Snail's Knock Out&quot; is a casual shooting game featuring Snail, who loves battles, from &quot;Goonya Monster&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter the chaos of &quot;Goonya Monster,&quot; Snail's love for battle explodes in boredom!? Blast away the appearing undead to your heart's content, shooting and dodging in stages that gradually speed up!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAvoid what falls and hit the undead to blast them away!<br />\r\nHitting rocks or undead reduces HP, so avoid rocks and aim to attack the undead!<br />\r\nSpeed up as you progress!<br />\r\nAs time passes, the stage speed increases along with Snail's tension, so control Snail quickly!<br />\r\nPick up weapons and fight with your favorite weapon!<br />\r\nLaser! Gatling! Arrow! Use the unique characteristics of weapons to blast away enemies!<br />\r\nDefeating the undead that appear in the stage will drop souls. Collect souls to level up and strengthen your weapons!<br />\r\nSweep away with bombs! Clear the way!<br />\r\nWhen the bomb gauge is full, press the skill button to shoot bombs continuously and blast away all visible undead!<br />\r\nLocal Rankings<br />\r\nYour score will be recorded in the top 10. Keep challenging yourself to surpass your past records!",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Snail's Knock Out&quot; is a casual shooting game featuring Snail, who loves battles, from &quot;Goonya Monster&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter the chaos of &quot;Goonya Monster,&quot; Snail's love for battle explodes in boredom!? Blast away the appearing undead to your heart's content, shooting and dodging in stages that gradually speed up!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAvoid what falls and hit the undead to blast them away!<br />\r\nHitting rocks or undead reduces HP, so avoid rocks and aim to attack the undead!<br />\r\nSpeed up as you progress!<br />\r\nAs time passes, the stage speed increases along with Snail's tension, so control Snail quickly!<br />\r\nPick up weapons and fight with your favorite weapon!<br />\r\nLaser! Gatling! Arrow! Use the unique characteristics of weapons to blast away enemies!<br />\r\nDefeating the undead that appear in the stage will drop souls. Collect souls to level up and strengthen your weapons!<br />\r\nSweep away with bombs! Clear the way!<br />\r\nWhen the bomb gauge is full, press the skill button to shoot bombs continuously and blast away all visible undead!<br />\r\nLocal Rankings<br />\r\nYour score will be recorded in the top 10. Keep challenging yourself to surpass your past records!",
    "short_description": "From the asymmetrical party action game 'Goonya Monster' designed by Terada Tera , a spin-off work has emerged! Enemy in sight? Throw bombs! Blast away! &quot;Snail's Knock Out&quot; is a casual shooting game. Blast away the undead appearing in stages with increasing speed and relieve accumulated stress!",
